\\to}M:A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists N\\ (\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in \\beta_\\lambda^*\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_{\\beta_\\lambda}(N)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>强正规化结论针对所有兼容β归约序列；存在正规形是推论，不能取代强正规化。System F同时含项β与类型β。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-strong-normalization","text":"thm-strong-normalization","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-normalization-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\to}M:A$、合法项集与 $\\beta_\\lambda$ 取自 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]。$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Normal}_R$ 见 [[72-df-normalization-proof]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\to}M:A$、合法项集与 $\\beta_\\lambda$ 取自 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]。$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Normal}_R$ 见 [[72-df-normalization-proof]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\to}M:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Normal}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\to}M:A\\ \\longrightarrow\\